  "summary_md": "**Tanishq (tk) ([@tanishqk](https://x.com/tanishqk/status/2116212881125691850))** introduces **diffmap**, an MIT document format and skill for planning and reviewing agent code by design changes rather than line diffs, with service, mermaid and callstack diagram diffs, phase-per-commit widgets and comments you can copy back to the agent ([tanishqkancharla/diffmap](https://github.com/tanishqkancharla/diffmap), [diffmap.dev](https://www.diffmap.dev/)).",
